  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "John Williams was an American property developer who founded Post Properties and co-founded Preferred Apartment Communities. Educated at Georgia Tech, he built a career in apartment development, ownership and management. He took Post public as a real estate investment trust and led Preferred as chairman and chief executive until his death.",
    "confidence": {
